Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Every April I get mugged by mail\\NSame old dance, different jail\\NThey say freedom’s not free, but it sure gets taxed\\NAnd the reaper’s got a clipboard, checkin’ facts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Woke up with a fine for being alive\\NCalled it a fee to help “society thrive”\\NBut potholes bloom and billionaires grin\\NWhile I’m paying for wars I’ll never win
